  "notes": [
   "Counts match the parts list (36 pieces). The booklet pictures are small, so which piece goes where in steps 4-11 is partly a best guess.",
   "Fix: the 1x4x2 bar (b13) no longer rests on the grille tile b6, which has no studs. It now rests only on the yellow 2x2 plate b5, which has studs.",
   "The wheel-holder plates (b2, b3) clutch the underside of the 2x6 brick, so b1 rests on them.",
   "Stud positions on the arch are approximate.",
   "The 3 grille tiles are: one on the arch, one on the plate, and one on the side studs of the drill head.",
   "The boom pieces (b18-b24) and the drill head are joined by hinges and clips, not by resting on the body, so they have no rests_on to the body.",
   "The minifigure is not in the parts list, so it is not recorded."
  ]
